{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15477","headline":"雪夜寻太白道士 · 李端","name":"雪夜寻太白道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪路夜朦胧，寻师杏树东。\n石坛连竹静，醮火照山红。\n再拜开金籙，焚香使玉童。\n篷瀛三岛至，天地一壶通。\n别客曾留药，逢舟或借风。\n出游居鹤上，避祸入羊中。\n过洞偏回首，登门未发蒙。\n桑田如可见，沧海几时空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}